 <name>Redline</name><summary>Open-source AMD Adrenalin alternative for Linux</summary>
 <launchable type="desktop-id">@APP_FULL_NAME@.desktop</launchable>
 <description><p>Redline is an independent open-source alternative to AMD Software: Adrenalin Edition for Linux, featuring a native Qt interface, CoreCtrl and LACT-derived supported hardware controls, live metrics, game launch integration and experimental recording. Feature parity is incomplete and hardware support varies. Redline is not affiliated with AMD.</p></description>
 <provides><binary>redline</binary></provides>
